            <trans-unit id="plugin.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Kainų lentelė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table.description" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards, comparison table or compact rows from one pricing table record.</source><target>Planų kortelės, palyginimo lentelė ar kompaktiškos eilutės iš vieno kainų lentelės įrašo.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.general" approved="yes"><source>General</source><target>Bendra</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planai</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funkcijos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Kainos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.highlight" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Paryškinimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Pavadinimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description" approved="yes"><source>Introductory note</source><target>Įžanginis tekstas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Rodoma virš kainų kiekviename makete, pvz., „Visos kainos per mėnesį, pridėjus PVM.“</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Įvestos sumos yra</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Nustato, kaip skaitomos įvestos sumos. Konvertuojama tik iš neto į bruto, niekada atvirkščiai.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Neto kainos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Bruto kainos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Mokesčio tarifas procentais</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Pagrindas bruto rodymui. 0 praleidžia konvertavimą.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Lankytojai gali perjungti tarp neto ir bruto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Nepažymėjus, puslapyje rodoma tik aukščiau pasirinkta parinktis.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Valiutos perjungimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Perjungimas rodomas tik tada, kai planams įvesta daugiau nei viena valiuta.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Atsiskaitymo laikotarpio perjungimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Perjungimas rodomas tik tada, kai planams įvestas daugiau nei vienas laikotarpis.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Valiutos simbolis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Anglų kalba paprastai rašo prieš sumą („€ 99“), vokiečių ir dauguma žemyno Europos kalbų – po jos („99 €“).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>prieš sumą (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>po sumos (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Button label</source><target>Mygtuko etiketė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to all plans without a label of their own. Empty means “Select”.</source><target>Taikoma visiems planams be nuosavos etiketės. Tuščia reiškia „Pasirinkti“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Select</source><target>Pasirinkti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planai</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups" approved="yes"><source>Feature groups</source><target>Funkcijų grupės</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features belong to the table, not to a single plan — that is the only way the comparison table compares like with like.</source><target>Funkcijos priklauso lentelei, o ne vienam planui – tik taip palyginimo lentelė gali lyginti panašius dalykus.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.title" approved="yes"><source>Name</source><target>Pavadinimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle" approved="yes"><source>Subtitle</source><target>Paantraštė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle.hint" approved="yes"><source>One line below the name, e.g. “6 job ads for 30 days each”.</source><target>Viena eilutė po pavadinimu, pvz., „6 darbo skelbimai po 30 dienų“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow" approved="yes"><source>Eyebrow</source><target>Antraštės eilutė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow.hint" approved="yes"><source>Small line above the name, e.g. “48 resources included”.</source><target>Maža eilutė virš pavadinimo, pvz., „Įtraukta 48 ištekliai“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.description" approved="yes"><source>Description</source><target>Aprašymas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Paryškinimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite.hint" approved="yes"><source>The plan gets a border and shadow in the accent colour, and a tinted column in the comparison table.</source><target>Planas gauna rėmelį ir šešėlį akcentine spalva bei tonuotą stulpelį palyginimo lentelėje.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge" approved="yes"><source>Badge text</source><target>Ženkliuko tekstas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty omits the badge. Common are “Popular” or “Recommended”.</source><target>Tuščia praleidžia ženkliuką. Dažnai naudojama „Populiarus“ arba „Rekomenduojamas“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Populiarus</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Mygtuko „Pasirinkti“ nuoroda</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Be nuorodos mygtukas nerodomas – nei tuščias, nei su rezervuota vieta.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Nuosava etiketė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Pakeičia kainų lentelės etiketę tik šiam planui.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote" approved="yes"><source>Note below the price</source><target>Pastaba po kaina</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “billed annually” or “excl. VAT”.</source><target>Pvz., „apmokama kasmet“ arba „be PVM“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Kainos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues" approved="yes"><source>Feature values</source><target>Funkcijų reikšmės</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features without a value count as not included and show a dash. Not every cell has to be filled.</source><target>Funkcijos be reikšmės laikomos neįtrauktomis ir rodomas brūkšnys. Ne kiekvieną langelį būtina užpildyti.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.currency" approved="yes"><source>Currency</source><target>Valiuta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period" approved="yes"><source>Period</source><target>Laikotarpis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.month" approved="yes"><source>per month</source><target>per mėnesį</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.year" approved="yes"><source>per year</source><target>per metus</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.once" approved="yes"><source>one-time</source><target>vienkartinis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.custom" approved="yes"><source>custom</source><target>kita</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own unit</source><target>Nuosavas vienetas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “per ad” or “per calendar”.</source><target>Pvz., „už skelbimą“ arba „už kalendorių“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.amount" approved="yes"><source>Amount</source><target>Suma</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequest" approved="yes"><source>Price on request</source><target>Kaina pagal užklausą</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel" approved="yes"><source>Text instead of the amount</source><target>Tekstas vietoj sumos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty means “Price on request”.</source><target>Tuščia reiškia „Kaina pagal užklausą“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Pavadinimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Maketas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>A checklist for yes/no features, value pairs for details such as fees or quotas.</source><target>Kontrolinis sąrašas taip/ne funkcijoms, reikšmių poros detalėms, pvz., mokesčiams ar kvotoms.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.list" approved="yes"><source>Checklist</source><target>Kontrolinis sąrašas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.pairs" approved="yes"><source>Value pairs</source><target>Reikšmių poros</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard" approved="yes"><source>Show on cards</source><target>Rodyti kortelėse</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard.hint" approved="yes"><source>Some groups belong in the comparison table only and would overload the card.</source><target>Kai kurios grupės tinka tik palyginimo lentelei ir perkrautų kortelę.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Show in comparison table</source><target>Rodyti palyginimo lentelėje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the group is left out of the comparison table.</source><target>Nepažymėjus, grupė praleidžiama palyginimo lentelėje.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funkcijos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Pavadinimas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType" approved="yes"><source>Value type</source><target>Reikšmės tipas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.hint" approved="yes"><source>Determines how the cell looks in the comparison table.</source><target>Nustato, kaip langelis atrodo palyginimo lentelėje.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.check" approved="yes"><source>Check or dash</source><target>Varnelė arba brūkšnys</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.number" approved="yes"><source>Number</source><target>Skaičius</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.text" approved="yes"><source>Text</source><target>Tekstas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.percent" approved="yes"><source>Percent</source><target>Procentai</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit" approved="yes"><source>Unit</source><target>Vienetas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown after the value, e.g. “GB” or “users”.</source><target>Rodomas po reikšmės, pvz., „GB“ arba „naudotojai“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote" approved="yes"><source>Footnote</source><target>Išnaša</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown in small print after the title in the comparison table.</source><target>Rodoma smulkiu šriftu po pavadinimu palyginimo lentelėje.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Funkcija</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included" approved="yes"><source>Included</source><target>Įtraukta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Taikoma funkcijoms, kurių tipas „Varnelė arba brūkšnys“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Reikšmė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>Skaičiui, tekstui ir procentams. Pvz., „neribota“, „iki 48“ arba „2.1“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Kainų lentelė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Kainų lentelė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table.hint" approved="yes"><source>The record holding plans and features. The same table can appear on several pages in different layouts.</source><target>Įrašas, kuriame yra planai ir funkcijos. Ta pati lentelė gali būti rodoma keliuose puslapiuose skirtingais maketais.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Maketas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Planų kortelės keliems planams, kompaktiškos eilutės nuo maždaug penkių, palyginimo lentelė daugeliui funkcijų.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Planų kortelės</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Palyginimo lentelė</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Kortelės su funkcijų grupėmis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Kompaktiškos eilutės</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Kortelės su išskleidžiamomis detalėmis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Taip pat rodyti palyginimo lentelę</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Palyginimo lentelė tada rodoma po pasirinktu maketu.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Palyginimo lentelė sutraukta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Palyginimo lentelė atidaroma tik spustelėjus – padeda išlaikyti ramų puslapį esant daug funkcijų.</target></trans-unit>
